# Theron's Quest (PC Engine CD) string template.
# Canonical English source-string template for Theron's Quest V1 runtime.
#
# Domain: theron
# Covers: Theron V1 in-game HUD, runtime messages, prompts, labels, menus,
#         item/creature names, dungeon depth/title text, world-serialize
#         save/load labels, shop purchase text.
#
# Source notes: Theron's Quest was published by Westwood Associates /
# NEC for PC Engine CD-ROM2 in 1992 (US) / 1991 (JP). The game used a
# small text surface (compact HuC6280 ADPCM-streamed dialogue + HUD)
# compared to DM1. This .pot captures the strings the Firestaff V1
# runtime surfaces through the M11 game view.
#
# Track 02 (PCE CD data track) holds the game assets; SHA256 anchors
# for JP Rev 1 (397039af02d50d15c70b74088eb8a1cb) and US ISO
# (3d8b78571dcd0e6eb8eb4b01eeb7fbba) live in src/theron/theron_v1_track02.c.
#
